 your deck of strategic cards.\n\nEvery card drawn is a gamble, every decision a test of strategy\nThe rescue chopper is waiting\u2026\n\nWith immersive VR visuals and Unique Gameplay, this will be your favorite card game.", "short_description": "It's a new survival horror card game and will probably be your favorite coffee break game time.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/survivaldealervr/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Owl Studio Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/survivaldealervr", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9132421976801953"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "893205199936720"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "2965483510305058"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3926593467619808"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "3926593467619808"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1768845600, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "893205199936720"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "9132592050118279", "version": "1"}, "id": "856552543079037", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_